{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ff3865e47f9b635867c05ec8dbd1ba6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1845568\" timestamp=\"1398187905\"]\nHi Kailin!\n\nWelcome to the forum! I sent you everything I have BUT I forgot to mention....\n\nMy fiance proposed back in March 2013. We were house hunting at the time so decided on November 2014 date for our wedding.\n\nBut because it was so far off we found the quotes we were getting for the all inclusive were too high SO we decided to wait until a year before the date literally November\/December 2013....if you can wait I would suggest it! Because your date is so far off you might find prices are based on standard pricing from their books NOT up to date pricing - hope this makes sense!?\n\nAnyways, happy planning girl! &amp;lt;3\n\nPam\n\n\nHi Tish!\n\nOMG you are so lucky to be able to go and visit the sites before choosing!\n\nAnyways, I have a favor to ask - if it&#039;s no trouble at all - would you mind checking and taking pictures of the ballroom at the royalton and posting them on here?\n\nI would and I&#039;m sure some brides would appreciate it! I&#039;m considering the ballroom (long story) but have no idea what it looks like!\n\nAny pictures you can post would be great! Just to give us an idea!\n\nWish there was more on this resort already!\n\nAnyways, can&#039;t thank you enough!\n\nFingers crossed you come back with an amazing review of the Royalton &amp;lt;3\n\nPam[\/quote]Hi Pam,\nI will definitely post pictures.  I am so excited to see the resort.  My travel agent lives here in the States but she is originally from Jamaica.  She set up the visit as she felt it would be better for me to see it first hand.  I am also going to visit Secrets again, just so I have it fresh in my mind. \n\nTish","Attachments":[],"Id":1845580,"PostDate":1398191271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 22 April 2014 - 09:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Kailin!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to the forum! I sent you everything I have BUT I forgot to mention....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance proposed back in March 2013. We were house hunting at the time so decided on November 2014 date for our wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But because it was so far off we found the quotes we were getting for the all inclusive were too high SO we decided to wait until a year before the date literally November\/December 2013....if you can wait I would suggest it! Because your date is so far off you might find prices are based on standard pricing from their books NOT up to date pricing - hope this makes sense!?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, happy planning girl! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n<br><p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Tish!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OMG you are so lucky to be able to go and visit the sites before choosing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, I have a favor to ask - if it's no trouble at all - would you mind checking and taking pictures of the ballroom at the royalton and posting them on here?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would and I'm sure some brides would appreciate it! I'm considering the ballroom (long story) but have no idea what it looks like!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any pictures you can post would be great! Just to give us an idea!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wish there was more on this resort already!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, can't thank you enough!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Fingers crossed you come back with an amazing review of the Royalton <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>I will definitely post pictures.\u00a0 I am so excited to see the resort.\u00a0 My travel agent lives here in the States but she is originally from Jamaica.\u00a0 She set up the visit as she felt it would be better for me to see it first hand.\u00a0 I am also going to visit Secrets again, just so I have it fresh in my mind.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tish<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c02d6f0e6a3ef37b49b6296de11c756","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1845580\" timestamp=\"1398191271\"]\nHi Pam,\nI will definitely post pictures.  I am so excited to see the resort.  My travel agent lives here in the States but she is originally from Jamaica.  She set up the visit as she felt it would be better for me to see it first hand.  I am also going to visit Secrets again, just so I have it fresh in my mind. \n\nTish[\/quote]\nJune is coming up fast Tish! I hope you have a great time! Looking forward to reading your review!\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1845612,"PostDate":1398198381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 22 April 2014 - 10:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>I will definitely post pictures.\u00a0 I am so excited to see the resort.\u00a0 My travel agent lives here in the States but she is originally from Jamaica.\u00a0 She set up the visit as she felt it would be better for me to see it first hand.\u00a0 I am also going to visit Secrets again, just so I have it fresh in my mind.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Tish<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>June is coming up fast Tish! I hope you have a great time! Looking forward to reading your review!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93551b8679da49858dd18c6609cb4049","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kail28\" post=\"1845536\" timestamp=\"1398179739\"]\nHi everyone!\nJust joined this site today and my fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a DW in Jamaica in October 2015. The Royalton is at the top of my list along with the Riu Palace Tropical Bay and the Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton. I too can&#039;t make up my mind and hope to read everyones responses and reviews to hopefully decide.\nCan&#039;t wait to go through this process with all of you!!\n-Kailin[\/quote]Welcome aboard! Seems like RWS is a popular choice not just for weddings; my friend\u2019s dad is going to be staying there in June, instead of staying with their family in Kingston. Sure inspires a lot of confidence in my choice, LOL!","Attachments":[],"Id":1845790,"PostDate":1398274085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kail28, on 22 April 2014 - 07:15 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone!<\/p>\n<p>Just joined this site today and my fianc\u00e9 and I are planning a DW in Jamaica in October 2015. The Royalton is at the top of my list along with the Riu Palace Tropical Bay and the Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton. I too can't make up my mind and hope to read everyones responses and reviews to hopefully decide.<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to go through this process with all of you!!<\/p>\n<p>-Kailin<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Welcome aboard! Seems like RWS is a popular choice not just for weddings; my friend\u2019s dad is going to be staying there in June, instead of staying with their family in Kingston. Sure inspires a lot of confidence in my choice, LOL!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389143480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.15.146.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81926fd0ea5077cbbd5c1b79c117c74a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Pam,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you for sharing what you have so far, can you send to my email as well? Rebeccaeakers@[member=\"gmail\"].com &amp;nbsp;I just stumbled on this place and am excited to learn more!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848148,"PostDate":1399168311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Pam,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for sharing what you have so far, can you send to my email as well? Rebeccaeakers@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com \u00a0I just stumbled on this place and am excited to learn more!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccaeakers@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.15.146.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1364924601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268097.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":188,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"infinitybride15","Id":268097,"Name":"infinitybride15","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.236.106.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b741d639ca9ae9d632dd979be2e68ec","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"pamelas21\"] I&#039;m also looking into this resort! Can you please email the info that you have? Soewedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com thanks for your help. Congrats brides! \nHi Brides! I&#039;m knew to this site and I&#039;m so indecisive about where my fianc\u00e9 and I should have our wedding (June 2015). Strangely, neither of us have never been to Jamaica so it will be a new experience for the both of us. I look forward to sharing experiences with you all. Congrats!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848181,"PostDate":1399215541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> I'm also looking into this resort! Can you please email the info that you have? Soewedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com thanks for your help. Congrats brides! <br \/>Hi Brides! I'm knew to this site and I'm so indecisive about where my fianc\u00e9 and I should have our wedding (June 2015). Strangely, neither of us have never been to Jamaica so it will be a new experience for the both of us. I look forward to sharing experiences with you all. Congrats! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.236.233.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398955837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SoEze","Id":277799,"Name":"SoEze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.252.107.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afde6ec7a1c50b1f60e9a22956844656","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations to the aspiring couples, RWS is a very beautiful place to get marry. If you are interested in beautiful creative and artistic photography &amp;amp; cinematography you can drop by our website to see our work &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.oristocratz.com&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.oristocratz.com&lt;\/a&gt; or visit our facebook page @ &lt;a&gt;&amp;nbsp;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/oristocratz&lt;\/a&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848207,"PostDate":1399229474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations to the aspiring couples, RWS is a very beautiful place to get marry. If you are interested in beautiful creative and artistic photography & cinematography you can drop by our website to see our work <a href='http:\/\/www.oristocratz.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.oristocratz.com<\/a> or visit our facebook page @ <a>\u00a0https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/oristocratz<\/a> <\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"obrien@oristocratz.com","IpAddress":"72.252.107.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399228099,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"oristocratz","Id":277827,"Name":"oristocratz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"643a612dd73b24d64feb57bcc0ed3e0a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"infinitybride15\" post=\"1848148\" timestamp=\"1399168311\"]\nHi Pam, \n\nThank you for sharing what you have so far, can you send to my email as well? Rebeccaeakers@[member=\"gmail\"].com  I just stumbled on this place and am excited to learn more!![\/quote]\nHi Rebecca! I sent you everything!\n[quote name=\"SoEze\" post=\"1848181\" timestamp=\"1399215541\"]\nHi @[member=\"pamelas21\"] I&#039;m also looking into this resort! Can you please email the info that you have? Soewedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com thanks for your help. Congrats brides!\nHi Brides! I&#039;m knew to this site and I&#039;m so indecisive about where my fianc\u00e9 and I should have our wedding (June 2015). Strangely, neither of us have never been to Jamaica so it will be a new experience for the both of us. I look forward to sharing experiences with you all. Congrats![\/quote]\nHi SoEze! I sent you everything as well!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848312,"PostDate":1399313469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>infinitybride15, on 03 May 2014 - 05:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Pam,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for sharing what you have so far, can you send to my email as well? Rebeccaeakers@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com \u00a0I just stumbled on this place and am excited to learn more!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Rebecca! I sent you everything!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SoEze, on 04 May 2014 - 06:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> I'm also looking into this resort! Can you please email the info that you have? Soewedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com thanks for your help. Congrats brides!<br>\nHi Brides! I'm knew to this site and I'm so indecisive about where my fianc\u00e9 and I should have our wedding (June 2015). Strangely, neither of us have never been to Jamaica so it will be a new experience for the both of us. I look forward to sharing experiences with you all. Congrats!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi SoEze! I sent you everything as well!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6948392042b33322050a5673258481a8","RawContent":"Congrats ladies! I have requested a date in January 2015. Fingers crossed the Royalton gets back to me with good news :) I considered the Iberostar Rose Hall, Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton and the Gran Bahia before deciding on the Royalton. I love the smaller more intimate feel of this resort. I hope they have all the kinks worked out by next year. The reviews seem to be getting better lately!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848393,"PostDate":1399382601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats ladies! I have requested a date in January 2015. Fingers crossed the Royalton gets back to me with good news <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I considered the Iberostar Rose Hall, Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton and the Gran Bahia before deciding on the Royalton. I love the smaller more intimate feel of this resort. I hope they have all the kinks worked out by next year. The reviews seem to be getting better lately!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399382376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5671ca9d4ce115b3dfb01da018f64fdc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bridetobe771\" post=\"1848393\" timestamp=\"1399382601\"]\nCongrats ladies! I have requested a date in January 2015. Fingers crossed the Royalton gets back to me with good news :) I considered the Iberostar Rose Hall, Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton and the Gran Bahia before deciding on the Royalton. I love the smaller more intimate feel of this resort. I hope they have all the kinks worked out by next year. The reviews seem to be getting better lately![\/quote]\nHi Bridetobe771! Congrats on your date! Are you from Canada?\n\nI loved the Royalton for the same reasons...I&#039;m getting married there in November this year! So excited! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1848396,"PostDate":1399383793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bridetobe771, on 06 May 2014 - 05:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats ladies! I have requested a date in January 2015. Fingers crossed the Royalton gets back to me with good news <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I considered the Iberostar Rose Hall, Grand Palladium Lady Hamilton and the Gran Bahia before deciding on the Royalton. I love the smaller more intimate feel of this resort. I hope they have all the kinks worked out by next year. The reviews seem to be getting better lately!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Bridetobe771! Congrats on your date! Are you from Canada?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I loved the Royalton for the same reasons...I'm getting married there in November this year! So excited! <3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98b2d2ca6ad18b60a8149cedec027e5b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1848396\" timestamp=\"1399383793\"]\nHi Bridetobe771! Congrats on your date! Are you from Canada?\n \nI loved the Royalton for the same reasons...I&#039;m getting married there in November this year! So excited! &amp;lt;3[\/quote]Hi pamelas21!\n\nI am from Canada :) Where are you from?","Attachments":[],"Id":1848397,"PostDate":1399384205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 06 May 2014 - 05:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi Bridetobe771! Congrats on your date! Are you from Canada?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI loved the Royalton for the same reasons...I'm getting married there in November this year! So excited! <3<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi pamelas21!<br><br>\nI am from Canada <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Where are you from?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399382376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":323,"TotalPages":33,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":320},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
